    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PolyRoyale: The Ultimate Battle Royale Experience</h2><br>PolyRoyale is an entertaining mini-game, perfect for social gatherings. As a user, you create a lobby where your friends can join (p2p network) to engage in a thrilling battle together with you.<br><br><strong>Jump, Land, Fight!</strong><br><br>Engage in battle against up to 32 players in Battle Royale or Endless Deathmatch modes. Experience action-packed combat on customized PolyRoyale maps, either solo or as part of a team. You'll encounter both AI-controlled bots and seasoned players. Armed with a variety of weapons, customize your character's appearance at the outset. Be prepared to jump from an aircraft, soar through the skies, and find the best landing spot. Show that you're a true survivor because, in the end, only one can emerge victorious!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Achieve impressive milestones (Achievements) for your outstanding performance.</li></ul><br><strong>Battle Royale</strong><br>Face the challenge and battle for supremacy in Solo, Duo, or Squad modes. But beware, you're trapped in a shrinking cylinder that constantly changes its position!<br><br><strong>Endless Deathmatch</strong><br>In Endless Deathmatch, players engage in an endless battle against each other. Here, you have the option to compete solo, as a duo, or within a squad!<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>AI-controlled bots<br></li><li>Battle Royale mode<br></li><li>Endless Deathmatch mode<br></li><li>Game modes: Solo, Duo, Squad<br></li><li>Diverse arsenal of weapons<br></li><li>Custom character customization<br></li><li>Varied maps<br></li><li>A limited selection of vehicles<br></li><li>Customizable player count (system-dependent)<br></li><li>Online connectivity via P2P network</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PolyRoyale: The Ultimate Battle Royale Experience</h2><br>PolyRoyale is an entertaining mini-game, perfect for social gatherings. As a user, you create a lobby where your friends can join (p2p network) to engage in a thrilling battle together with you.<br><br><strong>Jump, Land, Fight!</strong><br><br>Engage in battle against up to 32 players in Battle Royale or Endless Deathmatch modes. Experience action-packed combat on customized PolyRoyale maps, either solo or as part of a team. You'll encounter both AI-controlled bots and seasoned players. Armed with a variety of weapons, customize your character's appearance at the outset. Be prepared to jump from an aircraft, soar through the skies, and find the best landing spot. Show that you're a true survivor because, in the end, only one can emerge victorious!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Achieve impressive milestones (Achievements) for your outstanding performance.</li></ul><br><strong>Battle Royale</strong><br>Face the challenge and battle for supremacy in Solo, Duo, or Squad modes. But beware, you're trapped in a shrinking cylinder that constantly changes its position!<br><br><strong>Endless Deathmatch</strong><br>In Endless Deathmatch, players engage in an endless battle against each other. Here, you have the option to compete solo, as a duo, or within a squad!<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>AI-controlled bots<br></li><li>Battle Royale mode<br></li><li>Endless Deathmatch mode<br></li><li>Game modes: Solo, Duo, Squad<br></li><li>Diverse arsenal of weapons<br></li><li>Custom character customization<br></li><li>Varied maps<br></li><li>A limited selection of vehicles<br></li><li>Customizable player count (system-dependent)<br></li><li>Online connectivity via P2P network</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Jump, Land, Fight! Immerse yourself in the world of Battle Royale and Endless Deathmatch on diverse PolyRoyale maps. Whether you play solo, as a duo, or in a squad, you have a plethora of weapons at your disposal. However, in the end, only one can emerge as the victor! (Mini-Game)",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, French, Polish, Turkish, Spanish - Spain, Italian, Finnish, Swedish, Dutch, Danish, Norwegian, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Bulgarian, Simplified Chinese, Russian, Japanese, Hungarian, Vietnamese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
